  "status_of_d": "MODEL OUTPUT, NOT A MEASUREMENT. Nothing was injected into this corpus, so no d here has ever been checked against a known input. d is what the three equations return once f is eliminated; if the assumption they rest on -- that the two chains fail independently given the sky -- is wrong, so is every d beside it."
